  *
  * Journal Metrics scheduled task registry (OJS 3.4, read by the Acron
  * plugin; OJS 3.5 registers the same task in code through
  * JournalMetricsPlugin::registerSchedules): the chunked snapshot
  * computation. <frequency minute="0"/> = at most once per hour; the task
  * resumes an unfinished cycle on each run and starts a NEW full cycle
  * only when the last completed cycle is older than ~20 hours, so a full
  * recomputation still happens once per day while unfinished cycles can
  * progress hourly.
  -->

<scheduled_tasks>
	<task class="APP\plugins\generic\journalMetrics\classes\JournalMetricsSnapshotTask">
		<descr>Compute the nightly Journal Metrics snapshot (chunked).</descr>
		<frequency minute="0"/>
	</task>
</scheduled_tasks>
